  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">About Our Brand and Products</h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Casa Rolio is revolutionizing home décor for Gen Z and Millennials who refuse to settle for beige conformity. We're the bold, fashion-led alternative to IKEA—offering artsy, colourful homeware at accessible prices that let people express their unique personality through their spaces.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>What We Offer:</strong></p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Trend-led seasonal collections inspired by art, fashion, and social media aesthetics</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Bold, pattern-driven textiles, accessories, and homeware</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Mid-tier pricing (sweet spot between mass-market and luxury)</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Swappable \"dopamine décor\" pieces that refresh spaces easily</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Quality materials with reliable shipping and transparent standards</li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Think of us as a fashion house for interiors—where Rothko meets runway, creating spaces that spark joy and creativity.</p><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">What Makes Us Different</h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>We Fill a Gap in the Market  </strong> </p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">The audience is tired of choosing between boring IKEA basics and unaffordable designer pieces. Casa Rolio gives them a third option: accessible artsy design with genuine style credibility.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Highly Engaging Products</strong></p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Every piece is Instagram-worthy and built for social sharing</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">\"Dopamine décor\" creates emotional connections that drive purchases</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Story-driven collections give you compelling content to share</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Products designed to go viral on TikTok, Pinterest, and Instagram</li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Crystal-Clear Target Audience</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">We speak directly to:</p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">The beige breaker (tired of minimalism)</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">The curator (into design and arts)</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">The fashionista (loves mixing colors and patterns)</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">The trend buyer (shops aesthetics from social media)</li></ul><h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">How Affiliates Can Earn</h2><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>1) Commission Structure:</strong></p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-ch